{"ID":"20240205153902-9stg143","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153902-9stg143","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153902-9stg143\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104333-yc75lrs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205155417-yfc9bjy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104333-yc75lrs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:161,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:161\u0026#125;","title":"白花蛇舌草","type":"doc","updated":"20240902112227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206104333-yc75lrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104333-yc75lrs","updated":"20240206104340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产长江以南各地。\n【性状】\t全体扭缠成团状，灰绿色至灰棕色。主根细长，粗约2mm，须根纤细，淡灰棕色。茎细，卷曲，质脆，易折断，中心髓部白色。叶多皱缩，破碎，易脱落；托叶长12mm。花、果单生或成对生于叶腋，花常具短而略粗的花梗。葫果扁球形，直径22.5mm，室背开裂，宿萼顶端4裂，边缘具短刺毛。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t苦、淡，寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒、消痛散结、利尿除湿。尤善治疗各种类型炎症。"}]},{"ID":"20240206104334-exryzrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104334-exryzrs","updated":"20240206104334"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104334-tip8lss.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155417-yfc9bjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155417-yfc9bjy","updated":"20240205155417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白花蛇舌草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白花蛇舌草-20240205155417-ct92pyf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717163619-acgrp2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717163619-acgrp2q","updated":"20240717165504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 716px;","style":"width: 706px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白花蛇舌草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白花蛇舌草 5-20240717163610-qv72hix.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 706px;\" parent-style=\"width: 716px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白花蛇舌草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白花蛇舌草 3-20240717163318-6qkkbjg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717165720-aefhx55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717165720-aefhx55","updated":"20240717165748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 903px;","style":"width: 893px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白花蛇舌草 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白花蛇舌草 4-20240717163431-kr1jg40.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 893px;\" parent-style=\"width: 903px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717163431-6mi35ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717163431-6mi35ay","updated":"20240717165550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Pro